第17集
【EPISODE 17】

17-1 任职仪式广场 日 内
INT. PROMOTION CEREMONY HALL — DAY

人物：凯恩、伊芙、塞娜、塞娜母亲、卡伦、雷顿、诺克斯、龙套若干
CHARACTERS: Kane, Eve, Sienna, Sienna's Mother, Castor, Layton, Noah, Bystanders

△ 卡伦残破的机甲面罩上，辅助瞄准系统的红光因为系统紊乱而疯狂闪烁。他看着跪了一地的官员，犹如看着一群疯子。
△ Through Castor's wrecked helm visor, the targeting array's red light strobes wildly with system errors. He looks at the floor full of kneeling officers like they've all lost their minds.

卡伦（满脸错愕震怒，指着雷顿与众人咆哮）：你们说什么？让我给这两个下等人道歉？
CASTOR (face caught between shock and rage, jabbing his finger at Layton and the others): WHAT? Me? Apologize to THEM?!

△雷顿的防弹战术服已经被冷汗彻底浸透，他面部肌肉因为极度的恐惧而疯狂抽搐，几乎是连滚带爬地凑到卡伦的机甲腿边。
△ Layton's bulletproof tactical gear is soaked through with cold sweat. His facial muscles spasm from sheer terror. He half-crawls up to the foot of Castor's mecha.

雷顿（脸色惨白，硬着头皮上前）：卡伦团长，你就道个歉吧！我这是为你好！
LAYTON (white-faced, pushing through): Commander Barron, please — apologize! I'm trying to SAVE you!

△卡伦机甲背部的微型核聚变引擎，因为主人的狂怒，猛地喷射出两股刺眼的赤红色高温尾焰，将周围的碎玻璃瞬间融化。
△ Castor's micro-fusion engine roars in time with his fury — twin jets of blinding red exhaust shoot from the back of his mecha, melting the broken glass around him on contact.

卡伦（瞬间暴怒，情绪失控）：放屁！雷顿，老子给你面子才喊你一声雷参谋！你不帮我就算了，我被打了，你反倒让我给他们道歉？你疯了吗！
CASTOR (snapping completely, control gone): BULLSHIT! Layton — I named you "Chief of Staff" out of RESPECT! She hit me and you want ME to apologize?! You’ve lost your mind!

雷顿（面色难看，急声低吼）：卡伦，我真是为你好！你别不知好歹！（被粗暴打断）
LAYTON (face ugly, low and urgent): Castor — I am genuinely trying to save you! Don't be ungrateful! (Castor cuts him off, brutal)

卡伦：滚一边去！
CASTOR: GET OUT OF MY WAY!

△ 伴随着一声沉闷的机械轰鸣，卡伦操控巨大的机甲腿，一脚狠狠踹开雷顿。
△ A deep mechanical roar — Castor swings the mecha's huge leg and BOOTS Layton aside.

△特效画面： 雷顿承受不住这种吨级的机械冲击。他犹如断线的风筝般踉跄后退数米，"砰"地一声闷响，重重撞在边缘由高强度复合装甲制成的合金护栏上。护栏被砸出一个凹坑，雷顿猛地喷出一口鲜血。
△ FX: Layton can't absorb a ton's worth of mecha kick. He kites backward several meters like a snipped string and SLAMS into the high-strength composite railing at the edge. The railing dents around his back. He coughs out a mouthful of blood.

卡伦（咬牙切齿，眼神阴鸷）：老子就知道你们这群人全靠不住！我这就联系我父亲！让他亲自过来，看你们还敢不敢让我道歉，看凯恩和这个野女人还敢不跪！
CASTOR (teeth grinding, eyes black): Worthless bastards! I'm calling my father RIGHT NOW! He’ll come down here — and I bet you won’t be telling me to apologize THEN. We’ll put Kane and his wasteland whore in their place!

△ 说着抬手激活腕间军用高能通讯器，淡蓝色全息投影界面瞬间亮起。
△ He flicks up his wrist and activates the military high-energy comm. A pale-blue holo-interface lights up.

△特效增强： 这不是普通的通讯，而是【军方S级紧急求援通道】。一道粗大的蓝色高频信号光柱直接穿透大厅的穹顶，射向阴霾的天空。半空中投射出数个巨大的、带有联合政府军徽的环形数据阵列，疯狂旋转。
△ FX: Not a normal call — this is the [MILITARY S-CLASS EMERGENCY DISTRESS CHANNEL]. A thick blue signal pillar punches through the dome of the hall, straight up into the gloom. Giant ring-shaped data arrays stamped with the United Government crest project into the air, spinning wildly.

雷顿（顾不上擦嘴角的血，再度冲上前，声音发颤）：卡伦团长！别联系总指挥！（被打断）
LAYTON (forgetting the blood at the corner of his mouth, lunging forward again, voice quaking): Commander Barron — DON'T CALL THE COMMANDER-IN-CHIEF! (cut off)

△坐在最高指挥官主位上的伊芙，甚至没有起身。
△ Eve, in the supreme commander's throne, doesn't even rise.

伊芙（冷眸微抬，语气淡漠却带着至高威压）：让他联系。我倒要看看，他父亲要怎么收拾我。
EVE (cold eyes lifting slightly, voice flat with absolute weight): Let him call. I want to see exactly how his dad handles this.

△随着伊芙这句轻飘飘的话，整个大厅的防御系统仿佛听到了神谕，原本因卡伦拔刀而升起的红色警戒全息屏，瞬间全部被强制覆盖成了代表伊芙权限的绝对暗金色。
△ As her almost-light words land, the hall's defense system hears a god speak. The red alerts that came up when Castor drew his blade get force-overwritten — every screen flooding to the absolute dark-gold of Eve's clearance.

△ 雷顿与所有知情官员瞬间吓得浑身僵住，犹如被集体切断了电源的机器，死死将头埋在地上，低头噤声，不敢再言语。
△ Every official who knows what's happening freezes solid, like a row of machines someone just cut the power on. Heads slam into the floor. Nobody dares speak.

卡伦（恶狠狠瞪着伊芙，直接对着通讯器怒吼）：父亲！我在边防执行官任职仪式大厅被一个野女人打了！求您马上过来！
CASTOR (glaring murder at Eve, screaming into the comm): FATHER! Some wasteland whore just hit me at the Border Enforcer ceremony! Get here NOW!

△ 说完直接掐断全息通讯，满屏的蓝色数据流瞬间炸裂成无数光斑消散在空气中，满脸嚣张得意。
△ He kills the comm. The blue data stream shatters into glittering specks and dissipates. His face floods with smug triumph.

卡伦（转头阴狠看向凯恩与伊芙）：我父亲诺克斯总指挥马上就到！凯恩，你和这个贱女人就等着死吧！
CASTOR (whipping back, vicious, to Kane and Eve): Commander-in-Chief is on his way! Kane! You and your whore — start saying your prayers!

△ 塞娜（上前一步，冷漠看向凯恩，语气带着居高临下的怜悯）：凯恩，卡伦的父亲诺克斯，是边防机甲军总指挥，权倾边关，地位仅次于伊芙城主。他一到，就算我想保你们，也根本保不住，这下你们真的没有活路了。
SIENNA (stepping forward, looking at Kane with cold, high-ground pity): Kane. Castor's father is Noah Barron — Commander-in-Chief of the Border Mecha Corps. He runs the border. Second only to Lady Eve. Once he gets here, you’re on your own.

塞娜母亲（尖声附和，满脸鄙夷嘲讽）：保什么保！这种看不清自己身份的蠢货，就该被狠狠收拾！
SIENNA'S MOTHER (shrill, contemptuous): Ha! That’s what he gets for not knowing his place! I hope he gets the beating of his life!

凯恩（神色淡漠，战神气场隐现）：我用不着你们保。诺克斯又如何，我根本没放在眼里。
KANE (flat, Warrior God field bleeding through): Don’t worry about me. Noah? He’s nothing to worry about.

塞娜母亲（嗤笑出声，眼神极尽不屑）：死到临头还说大话！活该你一辈子待在底层，当一只坐井观天的癞蛤蟆！
SIENNA'S MOTHER (snorting, eyes raking him with disdain): Still going on and on with your bullshit! That’s why you’ll never amount to anything!

凯恩（冷瞥她一眼，语气平静）：你这自以为是、趋炎附势的样子，才是真正的坐井观天。
KANE (a cold glance, voice level): I can say the same about you.

塞娜母亲（气得浑身发抖，尖声怒骂）：你个混蛋还敢嘴硬！等会儿我让你哭都哭不出来！
SIENNA'S MOTHER (shaking with rage, screeching): You BASTARD! Shut the hell up! You’re going to regret this!

△ 伊芙刚要开口，一道震彻大厅、暴怒无比的男声从入口处炸响！
△ Eve is about to speak — when a furious male voice tears in from the entrance and rocks the entire hall.

△音效特效： 伴随着这声怒吼，一股极强的低频音爆直接掀翻了大厅入口处的数张悬浮礼宾桌！
△ SFX/FX: With the shout comes a low-frequency sonic boom that flips several hover-reception tables at the entrance.

诺克斯（OS）：混账！谁敢在边防重地闹事！还敢打我诺克斯的儿子！
NOAH (O.S.): INSOLENT FOOLS! Who’s causing trouble at the border facility?! Who laid a hand on MY son?!

△ 诺克斯身披深色总指挥战甲，肩佩机甲军最高权限徽章，周身辐射防御光晕流转。那光晕如同实质的防护罩，将周围的空气都灼烧得微微扭曲。他身后跟着四名全副武装的黑金机甲护卫，宛如四座移动的金属山峰，沉重的机械脚步声使得整个大厅都在地震。他气势汹汹大步踏入。
△ NOAH BARRON (M, 50s, dark Commander-in-Chief armor, the Mecha Corps' highest-clearance crest at his shoulder, a radiation-defense aura bleeding off him). The aura is solid enough to warp the air around him. Four black-gold mecha guards follow — four walking metal mountains. Their boot-falls make the hall shudder like an earthquake. He storms in.

字幕 边防机甲军总指挥 诺克斯
SUPER: NOAH BARRON — Commander-in-Chief, Border Mecha Corps.
